# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every system: the tools
# write LF, and scripts/*.sh must stay LF to run inside WSL even when Git for
# Windows converts line endings (core.autocrlf).
#
# Los archivos de texto se guardan y se descargan con LF en todos los
# sistemas: las herramientas escriben LF, y scripts/*.sh tiene que seguir en
# LF para correr dentro de WSL aunque Git para Windows convierta los saltos de
# línea (core.autocrlf).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Game files are never committed (see .gitignore); if one is ever added by
# mistake, it must not be treated as text.
*.dol binary
*.gcm binary
*.iso binary
*.rvz binary
